LeetCode 3498 — Reverse Degree of a String

```java
class Solution {
    public int reverseDegree(String s) {
        int sum = 0;
        for (int i = 0; i < s.length(); i++) {
            char ch = s.charAt(i);
            int value = 26 - (ch - 'a');
            int position = i + 1;
            sum += value * position;
        }
        return sum;
    }
}
```
Remember These 3 Things
int value = 26 - (ch - 'a'); // Reversed alphabet position
int position = i + 1;        // 1-indexed string position
sum += value * position;     // Add product to sum

Time Complexity: O(n)
Space Complexity: O(1)

